1
00:01:23,943 --> 00:01:28,399
[Episode 12]

2
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:35,720
Will you spend the rest of your life with me?

3
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:46,840
What's wrong? Are you stunned with joy?

4
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,560
Say something.

5
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,320
Don't worry about anything else.

6
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,360
Zhang Zhun.

7
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,440
Trust me.

8
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:59,280
I can handle everything.

9
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,960
Don't be afraid.

10
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:03,640
Then give me an explanation first.

11
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:11,120
Well...

12
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:14,440
I thought it was beautiful,
so I took the photo.

13
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,440
What's wrong with photographing my lover?

14
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:20,120
The night before filming started,

15
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,800
you and I were not a couple.

16
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:28,680
Tell me, what exactly is going on?

17
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,280
What's there to explain?

18
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,040
We love each other now.

19
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,800
Does it matter how it started?

20
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:42,000
But I care. I really care.

21
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,373
Do you know how it feels
to be treated like a toy,

22
00:02:45,373 --> 00:02:48,693
being used by you in bed?

23
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,360
Do you feel like you've been used?

24
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,680
It's not about being used.

25
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:04,600
My girlfriend, my pathetic pride,
and my family...

26
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,720
I love you.

27
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,320
I was determined to be with you.

28
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,440
But what's the truth?

29
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:16,400
You've been lying to me from the start.

30
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:24,760
Is it really that serious?

31
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,560
It's just a few photos.

32
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,640
A few photos?

33
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,480
I... I always thought that night was a dream.

34
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,320
I thought I was the one who crossed the line.

35
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:41,760
That I had inappropriate thoughts about you.

36
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,920
That I shamelessly had a wet dream.

37
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,560
Don't say that.

38
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,560
It was me.

39
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,640
I couldn't help myself.

40
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:54,320
- I couldn't control myself, so...
- Couldn't control yourself?

41
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,360
So, it turns out...

42
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,680
you really only have lust for me.

43
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,680
In this relationship,

44
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,360
I'm the only fool who gave my all.

45
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,360
No, that's not true.

46
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,440
We are clearly in love.

47
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,920
Why else would I have proposed to you?

48
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,120
I truly want to...

49
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:23,360
I want to spend my life with you.

50
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,720
What do you mean by that?

51
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,200
Let's...

52
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:49,080
break up.

53
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:55,200
If I'd known that night was real,

54
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:58,040
I never would have fallen for you.

55
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,440
Zhang Zhun.

56
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:09,240
Do you know what you're saying?

57
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,000
I do.

58
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,600
I want to say...

59
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:18,600
Maybe I don't love you at all.

60
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:26,160
All of this... is perhaps
just a bubble we imagined.

61
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,640
This irreversible relationship...

62
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:33,320
is just the lingering warmth
of Fang Chi and Gao Zhun.

63
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,120
No.

64
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:37,160
You do love me.

65
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:40,240
With or without those photos, you love me.

66
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:43,440
You were trembling when I touched you.

67
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:47,120
When I called you,
you couldn't wait to cling to me.

68
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,520
Yes.

69
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:55,080
I do like you, but what about you?

70
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:57,400
You knew I was drunk that night.

71
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,240
But what did you do to me?

72
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,120
Zhen Xin.

73
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,560
Your affection...

74
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:09,520
was mixed with manipulation from the start.

75
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:14,920
To me, you aren't sincere enough.

76
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,820
Fine.

77
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,600
If you want to break up...

78
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,720
then we're done.

79
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,800
Hello, Qin?

80
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,600
Okay, I'm on my way.

81
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,840
I say, Best Actor Zhen...

82
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,160
I've been sitting here for half an hour.

83
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:18,400
Are you sure you want to keep drinking?

84
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,080
I've been dumped.

85
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:31,240
What else should I do but drink?

86
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,520
Dumped?

87
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,200
This routine...

88
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:41,800
is way out of date.

89
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,120
Actually...

90
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,840
you don't need to use tricks on me.

91
00:10:08,638 --> 00:10:10,520
Wait, youngster.

92
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,640
Are you for real?

93
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,680
All right.

94
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:25,520
Stop drinking.

95
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:29,680
Tell me.

96
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:32,240
With your looks and status,
who couldn't you get?

97
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,440
I only want them.

98
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:39,560
I don't want it to end.

99
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,880
I won't let it end.

100
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,480
I want to be with them forever.

101
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,360
Forever.

102
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,440
They're so cute.

103
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,440
And so sexy.

104
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,400
When they're drunk,

105
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:06,880
they're like a little kitten.

106
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:13,800
Feng Yun Ting is indeed quite cute.

107
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:17,640
All right, it'll be forever.

108
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:22,400
Since you can't let go, go after her.

109
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:25,640
But they said we're over.

110
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:31,360
They don't want me anymore.

111
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:33,600
Okay, okay.

112
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:36,480
They don't want me anymore.

113
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:39,160
All right, don't cry.

114
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:45,120
In this life, who hasn't
loved with all their heart?

115
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,720
But if it's not meant to be,

116
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:50,280
forcing it only makes everyone miserable.

117
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,880
It's better to part ways.

118
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:54,800
At least you keep your dignity.

119
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,920
Right?

120
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:59,760
You're so nice.

121
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:02,600
Just like my mom.

122
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,960
Mom?

123
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,640
Your mom?

124
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:11,320
<i>What is this?</i>

125
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:14,880
<i>I came here to get a man,
not to become his mother.</i>

126
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:17,940
<i>What on earth did that
damn gay Qin Yao arrange?</i>

127
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:36,560
Thank you for the ride.

128
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,200
I'm going in.

129
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,840
Wait a minute.

130
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:43,440
There's something I must tell you.

131
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,360
Because of this scandal,

132
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:47,600
Zhen Xin lost two endorsements.

133
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,920
One of them is a blue-blood brand.

134
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:52,520
The brand terminated the contract.

135
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:54,280
The penalty fee...

136
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,240
is this much.

137
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:00,800
That kid is stubborn.

138
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:03,440
He doesn't look back or care about it.

139
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:06,480
He's truly gone all out for you.

140
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:08,280
But I can't just stand by

141
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:11,080
and watch him ruin his own future.

142
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,440
This was just taken.

143
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,200
I arranged it.
[Zhen Xin, Qin Xun Er Hotel Rendezvous...]

144
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:25,480
Tomorrow, records of Zhen Xin and Qin Xun Er
staying at a hotel will be leaked.

145
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:28,800
All that mess between you two

146
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:31,120
will be cleared as much as possible.

147
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:37,320
Ms. Qin, you don't have to do this.

148
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,000
He and I...

149
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,720
are already over.

150
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:48,760
Feelings often come from impulse.

151
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:52,840
There's no logic to them,
and they can't be explained.

152
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:55,880
But time is different.

153
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:59,360
Time has its own weight.

154
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,560
What's real and what's fake,

155
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:03,600
what's hollow and what's solid,

156
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:08,000
in the end, only time can filter them out.

157
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,760
Only then will you understand

158
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:12,240
what is desire,

159
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,760
and what is true love.

160
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,320
I'll keep that in mind.

161
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:29,360
Good luck, ugly lad.

162
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,880
<i>Action!</i>

163
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,280
This isn't a dream.

164
00:15:10,639 --> 00:15:12,359
Of course not.

165
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:22,720
You're at my house.

166
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:24,840
Zou Yun has been arrested.

167
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:28,626
How did you...

168
00:15:28,626 --> 00:15:32,200
I called the police
as soon as I heard your message.

169
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:36,200
That was the only way I could find you quickly

170
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,840
and protect you as soon as possible.

171
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:42,000
Don't worry.

172
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,400
Your nightmare is finally over.

173
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:50,840
So, are you going to leave me again?

174
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,340
No.

175
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:59,360
I'll stay by your side from now on.

176
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:03,800
I'm certain that I can't leave you.

177
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,320
Then...

178
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:14,000
What is the relationship between us?

179
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,500
Your lover.

180
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,760
Fang Chi, it's Zuo Lin Lin.

181
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,480
Hello?

182
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,560
<i>Charles.</i>

183
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,080
<i>Can you come and see me?</i>

184
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,320
Let's talk on the phone.

185
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:59,080
<i>If you don't come, I'll slit my wrists.</i>

186
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:02,200
Zuo Lin Lin, stop it.

187
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,960
<i>I'll give you half an hour.</i>

188
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:06,680
<i>If you don't come, I'll kill myself.</i>

189
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,240
Go ahead.

190
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,360
I'll wait for you here.

191
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,560
"Here"?

192
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:22,280
Change the word.

193
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,120
Home.

194
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:29,762
Be good and wait for me at home.

195
00:17:29,762 --> 00:17:31,562
I'll be back soon.

196
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:46,400
Charles, let's get back together.

197
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,639
Stop messing around.

198
00:17:47,639 --> 00:17:49,760
I don't love you anymore.

199
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,920
That's impossible.

200
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,520
You're blaming me, aren't you?

201
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:55,360
You're bothered by Gao Zhun, aren't you?

202
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:56,480
It's all his fault.

203
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,680
He lied to me.

204
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,280
I didn't expect him to be so shameless.

205
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:01,440
Don't slander him.

206
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:03,920
I'm slandering him?

207
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:06,720
He's always... so condescending.

208
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:09,040
Do you really think he sees you as a friend?

209
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,800
If he weren't sick, he wouldn't care about you.

210
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,480
That's enough.

211
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:16,880
I have a lover.

212
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:20,200
Don't lie to me.

213
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:23,560
No other woman is good enough for you.

214
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:30,160
I like men.

215
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:34,880
And we're already living together.

216
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:41,440
Fang Chi, how can you use such a lame excuse?

217
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:43,280
It's true.

218
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,680
He's someone...

219
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:51,360
I want to protect for the rest of my life.

220
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,560
You like men?

221
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:56,680
Then what does that make me?

222
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,800
I'm sorry.

223
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:03,599
After I met him,

224
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:05,840
I finally learned what love is.

225
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:10,920
It's not eating, shopping, or movies.

226
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:14,000
It's a matter of life and death.

227
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:17,280
It's heartbreaking.

228
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,960
No, that's impossible.

229
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,156
You're just trying to spite me, right?

230
00:19:21,156 --> 00:19:22,840
You're talking nonsense, aren't you?

231
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:26,080
You're a man. You should be with me.

232
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,600
You...

233
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:37,400
How could you...

234
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,520
Zhun, I'm home.

235
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:16,040
I'm here.

236
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,240
You...

237
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:27,320
Since when?

238
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:29,920
I've long since...

239
00:20:32,325 --> 00:20:37,440
[Zuo Lin Lin]

240
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,480
<i>Gao Zhun.</i>

241
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,520
<i>I shouldn't be calling you after the breakup.</i>

242
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:42,200
<i>But there's something I have to tell you.</i>

243
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,240
<i>Stay away from Fang Chi.</i>

244
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,240
Why?

245
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,480
<i>He's gay.</i>

246
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:46,880
<i>He's even living with a man.</i>

247
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:50,240
Anything else? I'm quite busy right now.

248
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,240
<i>Please.</i>

249
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,840
<i>I'm calling to warn you out of kindness.</i>

250
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:53,920
<i>I don't want you to get hurt.</i>

251
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,000
That person is me.

252
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:59,640
<i>- What did you say?</i>
- I'm the one living with him.

253
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:07,120
Is it serious?

254
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:08,920
It was serious.

255
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,960
But I got lucky.

256
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:14,120
I found my medicine.

257
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,420
<i>Cut!</i>

258
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,320
Let's shoot the last scene.

259
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:45,840
Let's give it a beautiful ending.

260
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:47,800
Then we can wrap up the production.

261
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:49,000
Come on.

262
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,080
Last scene.

263
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:52,040
Everyone, get ready.

264
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,540
Action!
[Deep In, A005, Scene 12, Shot 1, Take 2]

265
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:04,320
Why do I have to be the one to tie it?

266
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:07,480
If you do it, I'll have good luck.

267
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:13,360
My man is indeed the most handsome.

268
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:57,160
[Eight months later]

269
00:23:05,120 --> 00:23:06,960
Master.

270
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:09,680
I'm counting on you for everything.

271
00:23:10,320 --> 00:23:12,520
Don't worry.

272
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:14,600
Once the ancestral graves are moved,

273
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:19,400
your child's misfortune
will naturally be resolved.

274
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:23,280
Scamming the elderly
will bring divine punishment upon you.

275
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:24,800
Watch your mouth!

276
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,240
Watch your mouth!

277
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:28,000
You don't understand Chinese, do you?

278
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,720
Bitch! Bitch! Bitch!

279
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,880
Bitch! Bitch!

280
00:23:30,880 --> 00:23:33,520
Amitabha. Amitabha.

281
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:35,120
Amitabha, my foot!

282
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:36,320
You fake Taoist.

283
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:39,520
- Who's a fake Taoist?
- You'll be punished for your appearance.

284
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,520
You... You!

285
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:42,200
- God will punish you!
- I'll beat you to death!

286
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,920
Just you wait!

287
00:23:45,840 --> 00:23:47,840
I'm so mad, Grandma.

288
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:49,680
Grandma.

289
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:52,000
Didn't you download
the National Anti-Fraud App?

290
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:55,440
No, I don't know anything about that.

291
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:02,560
And you are?

292
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,040
I'm Zhang Zhun's boss.

293
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:06,480
My surname is Qin.

294
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:09,280
I'm here today because I want to talk to you

295
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:12,400
about Zhang Zhun and Zhen Xin.

296
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,920
<i>When someone's worried...</i>

297
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:23,920
<i>Recovery speeds up.</i>

298
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:48,760
<i>Mr. Zhen, I've thought of a few ideas...</i>

299
00:24:48,760 --> 00:24:51,680
<i>If you can't keep up, then get lost.</i>

300
00:24:57,080 --> 00:24:59,120
<i>Who do you want to play Gao Zhun?</i>

301
00:24:59,120 --> 00:25:01,440
<i>You're the one I chose.</i>

302
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:03,640
<i>If you don't pass the test,</i>

303
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,640
<i>it's my reputation on the line.</i>

304
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:15,160
<i>Zhang Zhun is my only choice for Gao Zhun.</i>

305
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:18,440
<i>I can't find the right feeling
with anyone else.</i>

306
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:22,280
The weather is so nice.

307
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:27,400
It's a pity I'm all alone.

308
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:29,280
<i>I heard that.</i>

309
00:25:29,280 --> 00:25:31,160
<i>Heard what?</i>

310
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:38,726
<i>Just now, you called my name.</i>

311
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:49,880
<i>You have to trust me.</i>

312
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:53,000
<i>After all, I am your Dr. Fang.</i>

313
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:55,160
<i>Stop it.</i>

314
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:02,720
<i>Panther and ocelot!</i>

315
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,920
<i>Panther.</i>

316
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:05,440
<i>Ocelot.</i>

317
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:07,040
<i>Yes.</i>

318
00:26:07,040 --> 00:26:09,640
<i>I really need to hug my cat.</i>

319
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:15,960
<i>470.</i>

320
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,200
<i>471.</i>

321
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:19,200
<i>472.</i>

322
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:23,200
<i>From the moment you left the restaurant,</i>

323
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:28,160
<i>you took exactly 472 steps.</i>

324
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:34,160
<i>You were on the phone,
and I was following behind you.</i>

325
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:43,080
<i>Like a stray dog.</i>

326
00:26:50,320 --> 00:26:53,280
<i>I mustered the courage to come here.</i>

327
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:57,640
<i>But here at the end of summer,</i>

328
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:00,960
<i>there is no snow.</i>

329
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:12,080
And there is no you.

330
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:24,240
Hello?

331
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,360
<i>Zhang Zhun.</i>

332
00:27:25,360 --> 00:27:27,120
<i>The rough cut of "Deep In" is done.</i>

333
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:29,160
<i>The producers want the leads to record
an ending theme song for promotion.</i>

334
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,320
<i>It's for the marketing campaign.</i>

335
00:27:30,320 --> 00:27:32,000
<i>You'll need to end your vacation early.</i>

336
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,640
<i>Come back and record it.</i>

337
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:35,240
Okay.

338
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:44,400
Isn't Zhen Xin coming?

339
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,680
He's a Best Actor winner.

340
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:47,040
His schedule is packed to the second.

341
00:27:47,040 --> 00:27:48,640
He doesn't have the time.

342
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:51,520
Ms. Qin found a studio near his set.

343
00:27:51,520 --> 00:27:53,840
We'll just mix your vocals together later.

344
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:55,340
Go ahead.

345
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:16,840
<i>♫ I only want to ♫</i>

346
00:28:16,840 --> 00:28:20,260
<i>♫ Walk on the beach with you ♫</i>

347
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:24,123
<i>♫ Watching the sunrise and sunset ♫</i>

348
00:28:24,123 --> 00:28:28,496
<i>♫ Secretly burying it in my mind ♫</i>

349
00:28:28,496 --> 00:28:30,000
<i>♫ Perhaps ♫</i>

350
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:33,600
<i>♫ No one will remember our story ♫</i>

351
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:37,280
<i>♫ And you'll have better choices ♫</i>

352
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:39,640
<i>♫ No need to promise anything ♫</i>

353
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:41,480
<i>♫ If love is laid bare ♫</i>

354
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:46,640
<i>♫ Naturally, we'll love more ♫</i>

355
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:50,330
<i>♫ I never asked for much ♫</i>

356
00:28:50,330 --> 00:28:52,640
<i>♫ I see you when I close my eyes ♫</i>

357
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:54,400
<i>♫ And our regrets ♫</i>

358
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:56,520
<i>♫ Play like a slideshow ♫</i>

359
00:28:56,520 --> 00:29:01,700
<i>♫ On a constant loop ♫</i>

360
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:05,520
This rain...

361
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:07,040
It's hitting right on the premiere.

362
00:29:07,040 --> 00:29:09,040
Water brings wealth.

363
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:11,280
It's a good omen.

364
00:29:11,280 --> 00:29:12,760
Let's go.

365
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:14,120
It's almost time.

366
00:29:14,120 --> 00:29:15,840
We should head in, too.

367
00:29:15,840 --> 00:29:19,920
To be honest,
I'm really looking forward to seeing

368
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:23,000
the audience's reaction when you appear.

369
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:24,500
Let's go.

370
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:27,240
Wait for me.

371
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:29,440
I need to make a call.

372
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,320
Give me a minute.

373
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:35,760
My darling, the company and I
put in so much effort

374
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:38,120
to get you back on your feet.

375
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:41,200
Don't cause any trouble at the premiere.

376
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:44,000
Don't worry.

377
00:29:46,120 --> 00:29:47,840
Hello?

378
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,440
Xiao Chen.

379
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:52,560
Go back to the hotel now.

380
00:29:52,560 --> 00:29:55,440
Get the umbrella from my black suitcase.

381
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:58,080
I only want that umbrella.

382
00:29:58,080 --> 00:30:00,507
<i>Okay, I'm on it.</i>

383
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:04,040
Let's go.

384
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,360
<i>I like men.</i>

385
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:24,800
<i>And we're already living together.</i>

386
00:30:24,800 --> 00:30:28,480
<i>Fang Chi, how can you use such a lame excuse?</i>

387
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:30,680
<i>It's true.</i>

388
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:34,520
<i>He's someone...
I want to protect for the rest of my life.</i>

389
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:37,680
<i>You like men?</i>

390
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:39,760
<i>Then what does that make me?</i>

391
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:41,320
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

392
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:45,360
<i>After I met him,
I finally learned what love is.</i>

393
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:48,680
<i>It's not eating, shopping, or movies.</i>

394
00:30:49,360 --> 00:30:51,680
<i>It's a matter of life and death.</i>

395
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:54,680
<i>It's heartbreaking.</i>

396
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:07,240
Hello?

397
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,560
Yeah.

398
00:31:08,560 --> 00:31:10,680
I've been quite busy lately.

399
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:12,880
I have to leave right after the promotion.

400
00:31:14,320 --> 00:31:15,820
Right.

401
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,940
Yes.

402
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:25,000
How many times do I have to say it?

403
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:27,360
I don't need a girlfriend.

404
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,360
Mom.

405
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,960
Don't waste your effort.

406
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:31,840
I already have someone I like.

407
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:35,720
In my heart.

408
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:02,840
All right, Mom. I have things to do.

409
00:32:02,840 --> 00:32:05,180
Yeah, I know.

410
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:09,240
I know.

411
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:23,642
Why haven't you visited your grandma
in the past few months?

412
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:28,080
I still don't know how to face her.

413
00:32:31,760 --> 00:32:34,640
You'll always be her family.

414
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:41,160
You see, whether a person likes boys or girls

415
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:43,840
is determined by genes.

416
00:32:43,840 --> 00:32:45,680
It's the 21st century.

417
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:49,880
Many things can be explained by science.

418
00:32:53,360 --> 00:32:56,720
I'm sorry to bother you like this today.

419
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:59,160
Please think it over.

420
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:02,600
Mr. Qin.

421
00:33:03,840 --> 00:33:09,240
Can Zhun really be happy like that?

422
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:14,400
Liking boys...

423
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:16,920
That's not for certain.

424
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:20,280
But I believe that if he has your approval,

425
00:33:20,280 --> 00:33:22,480
he will definitely be happy.

426
00:33:32,360 --> 00:33:34,600
I know what you're thinking.

427
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:40,920
So, don't carry such a heavy burden.

428
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:44,560
Whether it's you, me,
or anyone else in this world,

429
00:33:44,560 --> 00:33:47,120
we all have the right to pursue love.

430
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:53,200
You're quite lucky, ugly lad.

431
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:56,200
So...

432
00:33:59,680 --> 00:34:01,440
Do you still love him?

433
00:34:02,749 --> 00:34:05,737
[Premiere]

434
00:34:20,320 --> 00:34:21,760
Best Actor Zhen, you made
a surprise appearance at the premiere.

435
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:24,080
Why wasn't there any prior announcement?

436
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:26,400
If I announced it, there'd be no surprise.

437
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:29,600
Besides, I didn't want the hype and noise

438
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:32,400
to affect everyone's immersion in the film.

439
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:33,600
Mr. Zhang Zhun.

440
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:37,120
Netizens have called you
the most beautiful male star in the movie.

441
00:34:37,120 --> 00:34:39,440
What are your thoughts on this?

442
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:43,120
I'm grateful for the love
from netizens and fans.

443
00:34:43,120 --> 00:34:45,320
But I'm definitely not
the most beautiful male star.

444
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:47,720
There are many beautiful male stars
in the industry.

445
00:34:47,720 --> 00:34:49,480
For example, my senior Wu Rong.

446
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:51,560
Has a very masculine beauty.

447
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:52,560
Thank you.

448
00:34:52,560 --> 00:34:54,200
Some say you and the movie "Deep In"

449
00:34:54,200 --> 00:34:56,720
are the biggest surprises
in the film industry this year.

450
00:34:56,720 --> 00:34:58,760
What do you think about that?

451
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:01,160
First, I'd like to thank Director Chen
for giving me this opportunity.

452
00:35:01,160 --> 00:35:06,040
I also want to thank everyone
for their help and love during this time.

453
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:07,160
Thank you.

454
00:35:07,160 --> 00:35:10,360
Best Actor Zhen,
do you have anything else to add?

455
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:16,920
That's all for my interview. You guys carry on.

456
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:23,620
Don't go.

457
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:33,200
Continue with the interview.

458
00:35:33,200 --> 00:35:34,980
- I...
- Zhen Xin.

459
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:46,360
Am I late?

460
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:12,720
Zhen Xin, Zhang Zhun.

461
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:15,440
Not late.

462
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:17,620
Not late at all.

463
00:36:30,493 --> 00:36:35,462
[The End]

464
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:46,240
Stop filming! Stop filming!

465
00:38:46,240 --> 00:38:48,760
You're so close,
the shots are getting distorted!

466
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:50,680
Stop filming!

467
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:52,960
Qin Yao, you damn gay!

468
00:38:52,960 --> 00:38:55,600
Zhen Xin is gay! Why didn't you tell me?

469
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:57,880
My chest almost got crushed because of you!

470
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,200
What are you crying for?

471
00:38:59,200 --> 00:39:02,840
If they got crushed,
I'll buy you a new imported pair!

472
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:04,939
You... you damn gay!

473
00:39:04,939 --> 00:39:06,960
You gays will die a horrible death!

474
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:08,080
Shut up!

475
00:39:08,080 --> 00:39:09,800
"Gay" this, "gay" that.

476
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:12,320
Such a foul mouth. How unlucky!

477
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:24,960
What is this world coming to?

478
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:28,120
What is this world coming to?

479
00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:26,320
Are you done reading?

480
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:32,860
I'm still missing the ending.

481
00:40:34,353 --> 00:40:36,680
But I think Zhang Zhun is too cowardly.

482
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:39,320
You won't think so after you finish it.

483
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:41,000
I really like him.

484
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:42,880
I think Zhen Xin is even better.

485
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:45,800
It's just that Tong wrote you a bit...

486
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:47,760
unrealistically.

487
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:50,600
That's because she focused
all her efforts on you.

488
00:40:56,040 --> 00:40:58,440
When I told her our story,

489
00:40:58,440 --> 00:41:01,000
she cried many times in between.

490
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:02,760
It was all because of you.

491
00:41:02,760 --> 00:41:05,040
She even called you a crybaby.

492
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,960
Why do you cry so much?

493
00:41:08,240 --> 00:41:10,880
The world's judgment is terrifying.

494
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:15,720
I wonder if Zhen Xin and Zhang Zhun

495
00:41:15,720 --> 00:41:18,040
will be blessed in the end.

496
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:20,440
The world's judgment is terrifying,

497
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:24,240
but us holding hands until the end...

498
00:41:24,240 --> 00:41:26,520
Isn't that our story?

